@catalogUrl = http://localhost:5131
@restaurantId = 5c7811d9-b92c-4453-8f8a-4bdb9f089d31

### Categorias proyectadas
GET {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/categories

### Productos proyectados
GET {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/products

### Carta disponible para un local
GET {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/menu

### Crea datos: cambie code y sku antes de repetir
# @name createCategory
POST {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "HTTP_BEBIDAS",
  "name": "Bebidas HTTP",
  "defaultStationCode": "BEBIDAS",
  "defaultStationName": "Bebidas"
}

# @name createProduct
POST {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "HTTP_COLA_01",
  "name": "Cola HTTP",
  "categoryId": "{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}",
  "basePrice": 3.25
}

### Añadir el producto al menu del local
PUT {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 3.50,
  "isAvailable": true,
  "preparationStationCode": "BEBIDAS",
  "preparationStationName": "Bebidas"
}
